## Dynamic Thermal Risk Map

We introduce a **real-time, colour-coded Thermal Risk Map** where each area is classified as:
- 🟢 **Safe** (UTCI < 26)
- 🟡 **Moderate** (UTCI 26–32)
- 🟠 **High** (UTCI 33–38)
- 🔴 **Critical** (UTCI > 38)

Government authorities can instantly identify **high-risk zones** and prioritize interventions for **farmers, construction workers, elderly residents, school students, and outdoor workers**.

***

## Predictive Warning System

Instead of alerting **after** extreme heat occurs, our AI forecasts **when and where** critical thermal-stress conditions will develop:

> **"Between 1–4 PM tomorrow, this area is predicted to reach Critical Thermal Stress. Outdoor construction workers and elderly people have the highest risk. Reduce outdoor exposure, hydrate frequently, and authorities should issue an early warning."**

***

